## Pattern inspiration

The `#[sprachspiel::tool]` proc-macro implements a general Rust pattern:
generating a "parameters struct with derived `Deserialize` + `JsonSchema`"
plus a "trait impl" from an async function signature. This pattern is
widely used across the Rust ecosystem (any proc-macro that turns a
function into a function-pointer or trait object follows it).

The Rust ecosystem contains several other implementations of the same
pattern. None of their source code was copied verbatim into this crate.
The implementation here is original code, written from scratch for
sprachspiel's W2 Provider Chain.

